<title>USA: Coke Enterprises buy two bottlers for US$1.66 bln.</title>
<headline>Coke Enterprises buy two bottlers for US$1.66 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Enterprises said Monday it has agreed in principle to acquire Coca-Cola Co's 48 percent stake in Coca-Cola Beverages Ltd, of Canada, and the Atlanta-based company's 49 percent interest in Coca-Cola Bottling Co of New York Inc.</p>
<p>Coca-Cola Enterprises, the world's largest bottler of non-alcoholic beverages, valued the the acquisitions at US$1.66 billion.</p>
</text>
